 "<section aria-labelledby=\"expertise-title\" class=\"section expertise-section\" id=\"expertise\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"section-head\">\n<span class=\"eyebrow\">What we do</span>\n<h2 id=\"expertise-title\">Your science.<br/>Our shared <em>purpose.</em></h2>\n<p>From a single manuscript to a full regional education programme, every engagement is scoped around your objectives.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"grid-3\">\n<article class=\"card service-card reveal\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"service-card__number\">01 /</span>\n<span class=\"icon-circle\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 20h9\"></path><path d=\"M16.5 3.5a2.1 2.1 0 0 1 3 3L7 19l-4 1 1-4Z\"></path></svg></span>\n<h3>Scientific writing</h3>\n<p>Rigorous, publication-ready documents written by medical professionals.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Manuscripts and study protocols</li>\n<li>Clinical study reports and value dossiers</li>\n<li>Consensus and guideline development</li>\n</ul>\n<a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"services.html#writing\">Learn more <svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a>\n</article>\n<article class=\"card service-card reveal\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"service-card__number\">02 /</span>\n<span class=\"icon-circle\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M22 10 12 5 2 10l10 5 10-5Z\"></path><path d=\"M6 12v5c3 2 9 2 12 0v-5\"></path></svg></span>\n<h3>Continuing medical education</h3>\n<p>End-to-end CME and CPD programmes for doctors, pharmacists and other healthcare professionals.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Programme concept and curriculum</li>\n<li>Faculty and module development</li>\n<li>CPD administration and events</li>\n</ul>\n<a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"services.html#cme\">Learn more <svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a>\n</article>\n<article class=\"card service-card reveal\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"service-card__number\">03 /</span>\n<span class=\"icon-circle\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><rect height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" width=\"20\" x=\"2\" y=\"7\"></rect><path d=\"M16 21V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16\"></path></svg></span>\n<h3>Pharma consulting</h3>\n<p>Hands-on support from people who have worked in medical affairs, marketing and sales.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Medical affairs and brand planning</li>\n<li>Launch excellence and field force training</li>\n<li>Project management and campaign activation</li>\n</ul>\n<a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"services.html#consulting\">Learn more <svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a>\n</article>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>",
 "<section class=\"section section--tint founder-section\">\n<div class=\"container split\">\n<div class=\"portrait reveal\">\n<img alt=\"Dr. Ivan Olegario\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/img/team/ivan-olegario.jpg\" width=\"480\"/>\n<div class=\"portrait__tag\">\n<strong>Dr. Ivan Olegario</strong>\n<span>Founder and Lead Consultant</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"reveal\">\n<span class=\"eyebrow\">Led by a physician-writer</span>\n<h2>A mind for science.<br/>A feel for <em>communication.</em></h2>\n<p>Dr. Ivan Olegario is an ISMPP-certified medical writer with almost 20 years of experience in healthcare communications across private industry, the public health sector and non-governmental organisations.</p>\n<p>He has worked with agencies including MIMS, McCann Health, Ogilvy/GCI Health and Huntsworth Health, and has led writing groups for ministries of health, medical societies, the World Health Organization and UNAIDS.</p>\n<ul class=\"creds\">\n<li>MD, University of the Philippines</li>\n<li>Master of Development Communication</li>\n<li>CMPP (ISMPP)</li>\n<li>AIM Management Development Programme</li>\n</ul>\n<a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"about.html\">Meet the team <svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>",
 "<section aria-labelledby=\"stats-title\" class=\"stats-band\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"stats-band__head\">\n<span class=\"eyebrow\">At a glance</span>\n<h2 id=\"stats-title\">Focused team. Deep experience. Regional reach.</h2>\n</div>\n<ul class=\"stats\">\n<li class=\"stat reveal\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"stat__icon\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><rect height=\"18\" rx=\"2\" width=\"18\" x=\"3\" y=\"4\"></rect><path d=\"M16 2v4M8 2v4M3 10h18\"></path></svg></span>\n<strong class=\"stat__num\">2019</strong>\n<span class=\"stat__label\">Established in the Philippines</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"stat reveal\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"stat__icon\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"6\"></circle><path d=\"M15.5 13.2 17 22l-5-3-5 3 1.5-8.8\"></path></svg></span>\n<strong class=\"stat__num\">~<span data-count=\"20\">20</span><small>yrs</small></strong>\n<span class=\"stat__label\">Founder's experience in healthcare communications</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"stat reveal\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"stat__icon\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M3 21h18\"></path><path d=\"M5 21V7l7-4 7 4v14\"></path><path d=\"M9 21v-4h6v4\"></path><path d=\"M10 9h4M10 13h4\"></path></svg></span>\n<strong class=\"stat__num\"><span data-count=\"12\">12</span></strong>\n<span class=\"stat__label\">Current pharma, society and hospital clients</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"stat reveal\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"stat__icon\"><svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M2 12h20\"></path><path d=\"M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z\"></path></svg></span>\n<strong class=\"stat__num\"><span data-count=\"3\">3</span></strong>\n<span class=\"stat__label\">Regions served: SE Asia, Western Pacific and the Middle East</span>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</section>",
 "<section class=\"section section--tint publications-section\">\n<img alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"publications-section__books\" data-parallax=\"0.1\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/img/publications-books.png\" width=\"1536\"/>\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"section-head\">\n<span class=\"eyebrow\">Selected work</span>\n<h2>Good science. <em>In print.</em></h2>\n<p>Most of our work is confidential. These are a few public examples of medical writing by Dr. Olegario.</p>\n</div>\n<ul class=\"pubs\">\n<li class=\"pub reveal\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"pub__journal\">European Cardiology Review · 2022</div>\n<p class=\"pub__title\">Asian Pacific Society of Cardiology Consensus Statements on the Diagnosis and Management of Obstructive Sleep Apnoea in Patients with Cardiovascular Disease</p>\n</div>\n<a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.15420/ecr.2021.59\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Read article <svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"pub reveal\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"pub__journal\">European Respiratory Journal · 2022</div>\n<p class=\"pub__title\">Randomised trial of the P2X<sub>3</sub> receptor antagonist sivopixant for refractory chronic cough</p>\n</div>\n<a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1183/13993003.00725-2021\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Read article <svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"pub reveal\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"pub__journal\">ASEAN Heart Journal · 2020</div>\n<p class=\"pub__title\">Epidemiology, treatment patterns and in-hospital outcomes of patients with heart failure with reduced ejection fraction: an analysis of the Heart Failure Registry of the Philippine Heart Association</p>\n</div>\n<a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.31762/AHJ2027.0101\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Read article <svg fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"margin-top:32px\"><a class=\"btn btn--ghost\" href=\"work.html\">See all our work</a></p>\n</div>\n</section>",
 "<section aria-labelledby=\"process-title\" class=\"section process-section\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"section-head\">\n<span class=\"eyebrow\">Working with us</span>\n<h2 id=\"process-title\">Getting started is simple</h2>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"steps\">\n<li class=\"reveal\">\n<h3>Tell us about your project</h3>\n<p>Share your objectives, audience and timeline through our inquiry form or by email.</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"reveal\">\n<h3>Receive a tailored proposal</h3>\n<p>We scope the work around your needs and agree deliverables, timelines and costs.</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"reveal\">\n<h3>We deliver, with you</h3>\n<p>Evidence-based work, reviewed with you at every milestone until it's ready.</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</div>\n</section>",
 "<section aria-labelledby=\"consultation-title\" class=\"container consultation-section\">\n<div class=\"cta-band consultation-banner reveal\">\n<h2 id=\"consultation-title\">Have a project in mind?</h2>\n<p class=\"consultation-banner__intro\">Whether it's a manuscript, a CME programme or a product launch, let's talk about how we can help.</p>\n<div class=\"cta-band__actions\">\n<a class=\"btn btn--light\" href=\"contact.html\">Book a consultation <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6\"></path></svg></a>\n<a class=\"link-arrow consultation-banner__email\" href=\"mailto:contact@indigo-mx.com\">Email us <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"consultation-orbit\">\n<span class=\"consultation-orbit__ring consultation-orbit__ring--one\"></span>\n<span class=\"consultation-orbit__ring consultation-orbit__ring--two\"></span>\n<span class=\"consultation-orbit__ring consultation-orbit__ring--three\"></span>\n<span class=\"consultation-orbit__sphere\"></span>\n<span class=\"consultation-orbit__dot consultation-orbit__dot--one\"></span>\n<span class=\"consultation-orbit__dot consultation-orbit__dot--two\"></span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>"
